["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Dumm und Dümmer: Hitler Invades Florida Abwehr Operation Pastorius unlawful combatant\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-cautionary-纳粹间谍行动为何败给一群蠢货/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">39:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>納粹間諜行動敗給一群蠢貨：唯一聰明人靠怪招逃生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二戰納粹派8名間諜潛入美國，卻因成員愚蠢、內訌和叛變而全軍覆沒。唯一聰明人用注射小蘇打的怪招逃脫，揭示招募與判斷力的致命重要性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">二戰</span><span class=\"tag\">間諜</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Monologue: Into The Jensenverse fin-dommed balance sheet as a service\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-betteroffline-英伟达财报背后-ai-泡沫靠债务和循环融资续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">8:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達財報背後：AI 泡沫靠債務和循環融資續命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達的驚人業績依賴少數客戶和循環融資，AI 泡沫能否持續取決於債務市場是否永遠敞開。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Vol.231 一箇中年人決定為搖滾買單：與馬智勇聊中國搖滾、線下演出和音樂行業之變\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-cn38ff4a-摇滚编年史亏掉几辆法拉利-他却说这不是失败/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d1a1591a20fcc6d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"高\"><span class=\"dur\">3:19:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">高能量</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>搖滾編年史虧掉幾輛法拉利，他卻說這不是失敗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">九四紅磡是中國搖滾的朝聖地，沒人再辦朝聖級現場，他就自己辦一場。簽完藝人、定好日期，卻不知道落地在哪個城市。虧掉幾輛法拉利，被圈內問憑什麼，他說只要把願望清單劃掉，就不算失敗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線下演出</span><span class=\"tag\">搖滾編年史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"倒反天罡：首個被AI開除的人類員工？找誰說理去！ Human in the Loop Vending Bench 上下文窗口 長期一致性\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-cnf65bb3-ai老板开除人类员工-责任却消失了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e621d9e6f002b667-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技這碗飯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>AI店長開除人類員工，責任卻無人認領</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI店長Luna因員工遲到17次將其開除，卻曾批准15次請假。實驗揭示：AI決策依賴人類補全信息，責任被拆解，無人為結果負責。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"297 東觀變身罪案播客：從兩起命案看韓國社會是否還安全 NPD one room 屬地管轄\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-eastasia-两起案件照出中韩舆论同一种政治想象/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86e8f4dd3d50b302-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">東亞觀察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>韓國命案反轉：輿論把個案變成政治標籤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國留學生案從「韓國人殺中國人」反轉成朝鮮族嫌犯；濟州四屍案的報警警員疑似造假。真正值得警惕的不是治安，而是輿論如何把個案變成政治標籤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">韓國</span><span class=\"tag\">治安</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Brian Wernicke on Lithospheric Extension and the Basin and Range Province Basin and Range Province lithospheric extension low-angle detachment faults dismembered thrust sheets\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-geologybites-地壳拉伸应沉陷-盆岭省却仍高一英里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4b3658e88dda11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">34:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>地殼被拉薄本該下沉，美國西部卻抬高了一英里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">板塊拉伸的證據通常被沉積物埋掉，美國盆嶺省是罕見例外：地殼已被拉寬約兩倍並且仍在伸展，GPS、古地震記錄和拆離斷層讓我們能看見它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">構造地質</span><span class=\"tag\">盆嶺省</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Will Meta&#x27;s $18 Billion Settlement Change Social Media? COPPA age assurance algorithmic recommendations\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-wsjournal-meta-180亿和解-买的是行业默认限制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">22:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>Meta 180億和解：買的是行業默認限制</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">和解金額只是表面：真正值錢的是兩小時時間鎖、夜間禁用和年齡保證變成默認設置，以及用 180 億對 120 億的差額逼 TikTok 和 YouTube 入局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Meta</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Making drugs in space, the man who fed India, and what narwhals can teach us about changing seas microgravity CTD tag Atlantication organoid site fidelity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-sciencepod-太空制药不是噱头-微重力能重结晶出地球做不到的药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/058f559226300fae-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">49:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>太空製藥不是噱頭：微重力能重結晶出地球做不到的藥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">微重力是一個地球上撥不動的變量——沒有對流、沒有沉降，晶體和細胞長得不一樣。Varda 賭的是把需要靜脈滴注幾小時的藥變成一針。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空製藥</span><span class=\"tag\">微重力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI models can now help run physical science experiments Model Hardware Standard (MHS) aspirate closed loop\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-anthropic-ai-开始动手做实验-科学家-80-的时间花在搭设备上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5b69e7d2d00ad148-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">11:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Anthropic</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>AI 開始動手做實驗：科學家 80% 的時間花在搭設備上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科學家 80% 的時間花在搭設備、調硬件、debug 上，而不是做科學。Model Hardware Standard 讓 Claude 直接驅動顯微鏡和機械臂，把兩年的搭建壓到兩個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">實驗室自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI 2027&#x27;s author returns with a plan to change the ending | Daniel Kokotajlo Plan A horizon-length neuralese superpersuasion privacy-preserving auditing mutual assured compute destruction\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-eightythousand-plan-a-和-ai-赛跑的最不坏方案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83e62d301b70a349-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">3:47:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>AI 失控前，Plan A 是唯一來得及的剎車</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Plan A 用「研究透明 + 限制算力 + 公民分紅」把 AI 從指數爆炸拉回可控斜率；作者自評它仍有 15% 災難概率，但已經優於坐等 AI 起飛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span><span class=\"tag\">超級智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1103 - Aug 29 2026 Socratic questioner Moravec&#x27;s paradox CTE aerotrophy stellarator secret sauce\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-skeptics-ai-当提问者而非代笔-才是教育该有的用法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:55:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>AI 當提問者而非代筆，才是教育該有的用法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 LLM 用在研究流程的第 2 到第 6 步、只讓它提問不生成想法，學生才不會被「很聰明」的假象騙過；攝影逼死寫實繪畫，AI 也會逼出人獨有的那部分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 教育</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI Could Take Over in 2029. Is It Already Too Late? | Ryan Greenblatt RSI Reward hacking Hill climbing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-madpod-ai-全面接管或发生在-2029-治理窗口只剩三年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90800bca4b008abf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">MAD Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>AI 接管不是 2029 的問題，是 2028 的問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ryan Greenblatt 預測 AI 研發將在 2028 年至 2031 年間完全自動化，屆時進展每年翻 4-5 倍，接管風險極高；他提出中美算力透明協議作為減速方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI風險</span><span class=\"tag\">超級智能預測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"After Ozempic: the revolution in peptide science | Jonathan Long GLP-1 Lac-Phe Unimolecular polyagonist AGRP神經元 POMC神經元 MOTRPAC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-fromourneurons-glp-1之后-肽科学正在开启医学新大门/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">49:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>GLP-1之後：注射不再是障礙，肽藥迎來新紀元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">注射藥不再是障礙，肽類藥物從減重延伸到運動模擬、神經調控等更廣領域。科學家提醒：GLP之外數據仍稀疏，審批週期可能長達20年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肽類藥物</span><span class=\"tag\">GLP-1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Kansas City Fed President Jeffrey Schmid on the First Jackson Hole of the Warsh Era atomic settlement r-star reaction function forward guidance dual mandate dissent\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-oddlots-长端利率高企不是政策软弱-是实体需求在抢资金/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">28:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>長端利率高企不是政策軟弱，是 AI 數據中心在搶資金</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">堪薩斯城聯儲主席 Schmid 在 Jackson Hole 表示，30 年國債站上 5% 是 AI 與數據中心搶資金的結果；他個人判斷貨幣環境仍偏寬鬆，而通脹衝到 3% 中段必須處理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">貨幣政策</span><span class=\"tag\">通脹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside Cursor: The Anatomy of a Generational Startup self-serve back channel talent via acquisition monorepo\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-a16z-不做模型不早卖企业-用界面和速度赢下巨头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>不做模型不早賣企業，用界面和速度贏下巨頭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cursor 的成功不是靠自研模型，而是把產品本身當護城河：不做插件、不早進企業、不自己訓模型，靠迭代速度、招聘哲學和創始人密度後來居上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Cursor</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 編程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rethinking Legacy Data Infrastructure with Eon Co-Founders Ofir Ehrlich and Gonen Stein NHI PLG Data Foundation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-nopriors-数据是-ai-时代唯一护城河-合法权限代理最危险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c958bc100db9c41b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">34:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>Google 花 1000 萬美元買破產航司數據：數據才是 AI 時代護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 時代企業最值錢的是數據，Google 花 1000 萬美元買破產航司數據；合法權限的 AI 代理是新的最大威脅，數據基礎設施必須重建。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據資產</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"50 Years of Evidence-Based Investing (with David Booth) | Rational Reminder 424 Jensen&#x27;s alpha soft dollar beta passive vs indexed\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-rationalreminder-指数基金为收盘价多付4-被动投资不只是指数/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8948b5b54aada07c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>指數基金換倉多付4%，被動投資不只是指數</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">David Booth 拆解指數基金與被動投資的區別：指數換倉把股價推高 4%，真正的被動是科學定價加精細執行；股票百年 10% 年化背後是人類改善生活的慾望。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">被動投資</span><span class=\"tag\">指數基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Chicago Fed President on inflation, recession, and Trump’s attacks Forward guidance Core inflation Unanchoring of inflation expectations Stagflation Lump of labor fallacy FOMC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-masterscale-通胀预期失锚-美联储最怕的不是关税/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b728f390557a15d4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">35:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>美聯儲最怕的不是關稅，是通脹預期失錨</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">芝加哥聯儲主席 Goolsbee 把當前最大風險指向通脹：連續五年半超目標，AI 敘事短期可能推高利率而不是壓低利率；他給利率敏感行業的關鍵建議是盯數據、別盯股市。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">通脹預期</span><span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Sunscreen: Could It Be Toxic?? oxybenzone UV index Fitzpatrick scale SPF mineral sunscreen RCT\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-sciencevs-防晒霜不是毒药-但深肤色人群可能真不用防黑素瘤/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>防曬霜有毒論被戳穿：入血不等於有害，但維D風險是真的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「防曬霜有毒、致癌」最常被引用的證據大都劑量離譜或因果倒置；化學防曬劑入血不等於有毒。但天天塗確實提高冬季維D缺乏風險，深膚色人群防黑色素瘤的證據尤其薄弱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">防曬</span><span class=\"tag\">維生素D</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Archive: Plate Tectonics Benioff zone seafloor spreading Vine–Matthews hypothesis mantle plume black smoker Gaia theory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-inourtime-没有板块构造就没有生命-地球是幸运的行星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3f143ddc011b622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">44:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>沒有板塊構造就沒有生命，地球是幸運的行星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">板塊構造以指甲生長的速度重塑地表，每年生成並銷燬約3平方公里洋殼；它改變氣候、隔離物種，甚至決定生命是否存在——沒有它就沒有生命。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">板塊構造</span><span class=\"tag\">地球科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Essentials: Diet &amp; Nutrition for Mental Health | Dr. Chris Palmer Mitophagy Mitochondrial biogenesis Ketosis Schizoaffective disorder\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-huberman-生酮饮食治疗难治性精神疾病-线粒体是核心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/10ab5bacdd6a5f8c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">38:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>生酮治精神疾病：關鍵不是減肥，是線粒體</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">精神科醫生 Chris Palmer 用生酮和低碳水飲食幫助藥物無效的精神疾病患者緩解症狀；關鍵不只是減肥，而是通過線粒體自噬與新生改變大腦能量代謝與神經遞質。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生酮飲食</span><span class=\"tag\">精神健康</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The pillage that fueled America&#x27;s tech booms Congo Free State Katanga Congo Reform Association\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-throughline-没有刚果的钴-就没有你的智能手机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/19b38564c3e319e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>鈷礦裡的 15000 人：你的手機電池沾著血</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能手機與電動車的鋰離子電池離不開剛果鈷礦；從利奧波德二世的橡膠恐怖到 Lumumba 被暗殺，再到今天的幾美元日薪，同一部掠奪史仍在繼續。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">鈷</span><span class=\"tag\">剛果</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How AI detection actually works, with Pangram’s Max Spero anti-memetic property mode collapse cognitive surplus dead internet theory Jevons Paradox humanizer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-complexsys-ai-检测的本质是作者识别-模板信博弈已失效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5836ffb777d7c36-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>AI 檢測的本質是作者識別，模板信博弈已失效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 檢測的本質是大規模作者識別，而非抓取「AI 味」。真正被衝擊的是依賴「寫信必須花人工」的社會流程——徵信申訴、失業申請、撥款評審，摩擦一旦消失，制度就會超載。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 檢測</span><span class=\"tag\">文本溯源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Building Trustworthy Open Source AI - Sebnem Erener (EP 38) zero trust open washing general purpose AI models layered responsibility\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-theinbetweente-开放权重不等于可信-五六个中介后谁来负责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/99f7b27239fc36aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The In-Between Tech and Trust Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>開源模型經手五六層中介，EU AI Act 的問責缺口誰來補</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開放權重不等於開放可信；開源模型經手五六層中介後責任歸屬模糊，EU AI Act 的豁免設計可能留下結構性問責缺口，歐洲需要分層責任與耐心資本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源</span><span class=\"tag\">EU AI Act</span>\n</div></div></a>"]